  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ram Niwas@Pappu S/O Rudmal B/C Yadav vs State Of Rajasthan on 17 December, 2019 Author: Ashok Kumar Gaur Bench: Ashok Kumar Gaur High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No. 17475/2019 Ram Niwas@Pappu S/o Rudmal B/c Yadav, R/o Lisadiya Dist. Sikar At Present Lodged In The Sub Jail Srimadhopur Dist. Sikar ----Petitioner Versus State Of Rajasthan, Through Pp ----Respondent For Petitioner(s) : Mr. Ashwin Garg Adv.",
    "facts": "The petitioner was arrested in a case arising out of FIR No.511/2019, registered at Police Station Srimadhopur, District Sikar for the offence(s) under Sections 420, 407, 379, 272, 273, 120B IPC and Sections 51, 52, 57 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned Counsel for the petitioner submitted that the Co- accused-Oparam@Papu has been granted Bail by this Court in S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No. 17060/2019 (Oparam@papu Vs. State of Rajasthan) dt. 12th December, 2019. Learned Counsel submitted that the allegation leveled against the petitioner and co-accused-Oparam@Papu is identical (2 of 2) [CRLMB-17475/2019] and the matter pertains to stealing of milk from tanker. Counsel for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner is not having any criminal antecedents. Learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the bail application.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned Counsel for the petitioner submitted that the Co- accused-Oparam@Papu has been granted Bail by this Court in S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No. 17060/2019 (Oparam@papu Vs. State of Rajasthan) dt. 12th December, 2019. Learned Counsel submitted that the allegation leveled against the petitioner and co-accused-Oparam@Papu is identical (2 of 2) [CRLMB-17475/2019] and the matter pertains to stealing of milk from tanker. Counsel for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner is not having any criminal antecedents.",
    "respondent_arguments": "Learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the bail application.",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
